 stage is 2.3 feet. - Flood History...This crest compares to a previous crest of 2.6 feet on 10/14/1996. - http://www.weather.gov/safety/flood","instruction":"Motorists should not attempt to drive around barricades or drive cars\nthrough flooded areas.\n\nCaution is urged when walking near riverbanks.\n\nAdditional information is available at www.weather.gov.\n\nThe next statement will be issued Wednesday morning at 1100 AM EDT.","response":"Avoid","note":null,"parameters":{"AWIPSidentifier":["FLSMLB"],"WMOidentifier":["WGUS82 KMLB 070145"],"NWSheadline":["FLOOD WARNING REMAINS IN EFFECT UNTIL FURTHER NOTICE"],"BLOCKCHANNEL":["EAS","NWEM","CMAS"],"EAS-ORG":["WXR"],"VTEC":["/O.CON.KMLB.FL.W.0003.000000T0000Z-000000T0000Z/"]},"scope":"Public","code":"IPAWSv1.0","language":"en-US","web":"http://www.weather.gov","eventCode":{"SAME":["FLS"],"NationalWeatherService":["FLW"]}}},{"id":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.d90f51f935721618492e4ae3eecd269ec22a8880.001.1","type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-91.16,41.12],[-91.13,41.16],[-91.11,41.15],[-91.08,41.13],[-91.07,41.15],[-91.05,41.17],[-91.03,41.16],[-91.01,41.17],[-90.99,41.16],[-90.98,41.14],[-91.02,41.13],[-91.03,41.09],[-91.07,41.08],[-91.12,41.09],[-91.16,41.12]]]},"properties":{"@id":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.d90f51f935721618492e4ae3eecd269ec22a8880.001.1","@type":"wx:Alert","id":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.d90f51f935721618492e4ae3eecd269ec22a8880.001.1","areaDesc":"Louisa, IA","geocode":{"SAME":["019115"],"UGC":["IAC115"]},"affectedZones":["https://api.weather.gov/zones/county/IAC115"],"references":[{"@id":"https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.be5c8c59584accf0b524ccb1d0ec84d5b7ac037f.001.1","identifier":"urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.be5c8c59584accf0b524ccb1d0ec84d5b7ac037f.001.1","sender":"w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov","sent":"2026-10-06T09:36:00-05:00"}],"sent":"2026-10-06T20:15:00-05:00","effective":"2026-10-06T20:15:00-05:00","onset